Re-cut on main: e39312c (8 Oct) conflicted in chat.service.ts and was
never shipped. Same change, and now behind NEED_RECALL_ON = false.

MASTER TEST RUN ME-027, 2 of 2: „გია საცდელს საწყობი სჭირდება." was saved
as Gia's need. In a new conversation, „ნიკა საცდელს საწყობი აქვს
გასაქირავებლად." was only saved. Netai did not remember Gia, and offered
nothing.

When a run saves a fact about one contact, its end checks the owner's
saved needs on OTHER contacts (field words, the pre-match comparison). On
a match the reply gets one line in the owner's language with two buttons,
yes / not now. That happens only when the reply has no buttons of its own
and does not already name the person. Nothing is sent: a yes is an
ordinary instruction for the next turn.

The line and the buttons are new words the owner reads, and no yes on
them was found, so the switch is off (NIGHT_QUESTIONS BR). Off, no fact
is noted, so nothing is read or added.

DONE WHEN (after the yes): ME-027 step 2 names გია and his need
unprompted and offers the connection; zero asks, zero introductions.

